{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NAM","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"那鸿书","commonName":"那鸿书","title":"那鸿书","order":34,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"d79e693d9291c1181c46290aa4a5c562ffc6093c31b065e417b80f6ab1b31ef0","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NAM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NAM/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["尼尼微的灾祸"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"充满血腥的尼尼微有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"城中充满诡诈和掠夺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"害人的事从未止息。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鞭声啪啪，车轮隆隆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"战马奔腾，战车疾驰，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"骑士冲锋，刀光闪闪，矛枪生辉；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被杀者众多，尸骨成堆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人们被遍地的尸体绊倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这全是因为尼尼微像妖媚的妓女大肆淫乱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惯行邪术，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以淫行诱惑列国，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靠邪术欺骗各族。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"万军之耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我与你为敌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把你的衣裙掀到你脸上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列国看见你的裸体，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使列邦看见你的羞耻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把可憎之物抛在你身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羞辱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让众人观看。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡看见你的都要逃避，说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘尼尼微毁灭了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁会为她悲伤呢？’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我到哪里去寻找安慰你的人呢？”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"你能强过底比斯","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底比斯位于尼罗河上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四面环水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水是她的屏障，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又是她的城墙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古实和埃及是她无穷的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"弗人和利比亚人是她的帮手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，她却被掳去，流落他乡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的婴孩被摔死在各个街头。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的官长被抽签瓜分，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她所有的首领都被锁链锁着。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼尼微啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你也必像醉汉一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必寻找藏身之处躲避敌人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你所有的堡垒都像无花果树上的初熟果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一摇树，果子就掉进吃者口中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的军队就像柔弱的女人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你境内的关口向敌人敞开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的门闩被火烧毁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"你要蓄水以防围困，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要加强防御！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要走进土坑踩泥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拿起砖模造砖！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但在那里，火要吞噬你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀剑要杀戮你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要像蝗虫吞没你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你只管像蝗虫一样繁殖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如蚱蜢一般增多吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的商贾多过天上的繁星，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但他们像吃光田地后飞去的蝗虫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的臣仆像蝗虫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的将领像成群的蚱蜢。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们寒日聚集在墙上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"太阳一出来就飞走了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人知道它们的行踪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚述王啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的牧人沉睡，贵族酣眠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的百姓分散在群山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人招聚他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的创伤无法救治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的伤势极其严重。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听见这消息的人必鼓掌欢呼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为谁没受过你无休止的暴虐呢？","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"“底比斯”希伯来文是“挪亚们”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NAM/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HAB/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/NAM/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":19}